From: Amaral Adreno Tools <rickamaral94@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [LAB ONLY] tu: observable A740 readback totals and queue heartbeat

Keep GPU commands, barriers and format selection unchanged. A740 queue entry
heartbeat at most once per 10 seconds; eligible Eden recording counts are shared
across threads/TUs. Diagnostic overhead, not a performance build.

